lley","source":"https://boisedev.com/am-story/heres-where-to-celebrate-americas-250th-birthday-across-the-treasure-valley/?utm_source=boisedev-email&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=boisedev-am","author":["[[Sarah Jacobsen - BoiseDev Managing Editor]]"],"published":"2026-06-29","created":"2026-07-07","description":"Photo: Courtesy City of Boise The United States of America’s 250th birthday celebration officially kicks off this Fourth of July, and communities across the Treasure Valley are marking the milestone with parades, concerts, fireworks, museum exhibits, baseball and family-friendly activities. Whether you’re looking for a traditional parade, live music, or one of the state’s official […]"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},